{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "fc1b07797a28a59e797b4516b085d3d44a567a2ea9bb2dd42ab41b90f8fdca79", "ja": "ギャル学講座！　栄養学", "zh": "辣妹学讲座！　营养学", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e0b392a61d0a12862727c4022926a4ed97dbb117bd10332666d3133267ee00ec", "ja": "特番も折り返し、続いてはお料理コーナー。\nテーマは『ギャル飯』。ギャルっぽさを感じ\nられる料理ならなんでもいい！　とのことで\n……フワッとしていて難易度の高いテーマに\nアイドル達が挑む！", "zh": "特别节目也进行到一半，接下来是料理环节。\n主题是“辣妹饭”。据说，只要是能让人感受到辣妹风格的料理，什么都可以！\n……面对这个模糊又高难度的主题，偶像们将发起挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "57c99c13f473fee5f4e1d75fa3a253d1b7b82b086d0b62aeb7d19e76c158db9c", "ja": "そろそろ番組も、折り返し地点だねぇ。\n続いてはこちら……？", "zh": "节目也差不多进行到一半了呢。\n接下来是这个环节……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "e6c053d7fff3e1473df311edc18e5297596501570e8fbb9498be57aa26aec12d", "ja": "『ギャル飯、作っちゃおう！』のコーナー！\nイェーイ！　……って、待て待て。", "zh": "“做份辣妹饭吧！”环节！\n耶——！……不对，等等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "f5ff93ebdfaeef902159799660757b0bd923e1c0aa32fb0637c06db478cc0c06", "ja": "ギャル飯？　ってなんだよ……。\nキッチンのセットだから、料理するっぽいけど。", "zh": "辣妹饭？那是什么啊……\n看这厨房布景，好像是要做饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "940a8ea47d5c4472f4cac1fc9faeca72156d9a5145f5ae46915f1436cc39fc02", "ja": "えっと～……『ギャルが美味しいご飯とか作れたら、\nメッチャかわいくね？　ブチアゲ！』だって。", "zh": "呃～……上面写着：“辣妹要是能做出美味的饭菜，不是超可爱的吗？嗨到爆！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1004_null", "source_sha256": "5df89149dc89d32bc06ffcbc3d3492a429f4bf61dcdc4ba5fbaff0a48c9b5683", "ja": "『家庭的なギャルって、いいですよね！』", "zh": "“贤惠的辣妹，很不错吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a25a179a2f22d99b8c2dc8c7fb0840e40d1d71c12f5c0efee4bcec94e95aff4", "ja": "ただのスタッフの趣味じゃねーかっ！", "zh": "这不就是工作人员个人的兴趣嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c2e38e53ccff85a930dd377b7de7ac217d0a1c68e0487adb5ab64748f17aed4", "ja": "いい趣味してるの～、あはっ☆", "zh": "品味真好呢～，啊哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "95a97156c697c8277f68a320b1280d0945aaabfa800f88a709c090fa5e7c6b49", "ja": "ったく……ま、こっちにはヒナがいるから安心だな。\nあたしは料理、得意じゃないし。任せた！", "zh": "真是的……不过这边有小雏在，倒是放心了。\n我不太擅长做饭。交给你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "5be32e875d5050ee1511a50bea4631d6c6f6f91eeae7598632af8fbeadd0061a", "ja": "えへへ。このコーナーなら、\nあたしも役に立てそうだねぇ。よかったべさ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿。这个环节的话，我好像也能派上用场了呢。太好了呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "f74c691680fb69890b35d695fa190472a4ce3920bc2d6e6e74f55ec317fb8274", "ja": "おお、ヒナ！　やっぱ頼もしいな♪", "zh": "哦，小雏！果然很可靠啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1010_null", "source_sha256": "534fa7baae00a15067930d758b345c4cc51fd06d570cc8124bdacb019e522d12", "ja": "『ちょっと待って。\nただの料理ではなく、ギャル飯をお願いします』", "zh": "“请等一下。\n不是普通的料理，拜托做辣妹饭”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0812ecafcffda7c357bb1044e5497ceb286ee57ec9236ade0399d00efa280b9", "ja": "だから、そのギャル飯ってなんなんだっての！", "zh": "所以说，那个辣妹饭到底是什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1012_null", "source_sha256": "bb506ba7322e9ff9dec19c513dc00e2b00d2f4442d86e48e904d40e5cae5662d", "ja": "『ギャルっぽい料理のことです。\nギャルを感じさせてください』", "zh": "『是很有辣妹风格的料理。\n请做出辣妹的感觉』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "f9cee426fbc5abe6796bfe66941a96833c5fed7a59e95910c71d01a34f7711e8", "ja": "くっ、抽象的すぎるだろ……！", "zh": "可恶，太抽象了吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8a2324fa40863561bb53a4a7d9a5824b78dceb9c216c34853a42a5128e197fa", "ja": "見た目が派手だったりすればいいんかなぁ？\nううん……。", "zh": "是不是只要看起来够华丽之类的，就可以了呢？不对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "a19b6476ed4787b306ab6d4918c4c1290114ea9c8ea86a4dafe82fa77bacd5be", "ja": "したっけ、料理はあたしがするから、\nギャルっぽい盛り付けを、二人にお願いしていいかい？", "zh": "那料理就由我来做，摆盘就拜托你们俩弄得像辣妹风一点，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a9fcaac1e86e1cf13a4d6c05cdff50ea923a215a022b4150a6f0b3be3213871", "ja": "OK！　よーし、あたしと美希で、思いっきり\n映え映えに飾り付けてやるぜ！　見てろよ！", "zh": "OK！好咧，我和美希绝对会\n装饰得超级上相的！你就看好了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_04_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "4d252521c0eb92c0fcdae58439d8f92836610894bfa1c251ec1703ba4d25b90e", "ja": "それって、けっこー面白そうだね。\nよろしくお願いしますなの～。", "zh": "听起来还挺有意思的。拜托你啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
